# 8. One important correction to the previous design

I **would not let the LLM choose arbitrary `operation_id`s**.

The LLM can request:

```text
"Pay electricity bill X"
```

The deterministic payment service should establish the canonical operation identity.

Otherwise the model can create confusing identities or deliberately manipulate idempotency semantics.

Better:

```text
LLM
 │
 │ payment intent + mandate
 ▼
Payment Gateway
 │
 ├── validates
 ├── creates operation_id
 └── persists operation
```

Then the provider-facing idempotency key can be derived from that operation.

